---
description: Use the shared design system and accessibility defaults
globs: apps/**/*.{ts,tsx},packages/ui/**/*.{ts,tsx,css}
alwaysApply: false
---

- Prefer `@medmate/ui` primitives, layout, and feedback before custom markup.
- Style with Tailwind utilities mapped to `@theme` tokens in `@medmate/ui/styles.css`.
- Do not add `.css` files in remotes or inline presentation `style`.
- Keep copy in feature constants. Honor reduced motion and visible focus.
- Follow `docs/design-system/README.md`.
